r change, no public API change, and `just [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]check` green after each phase.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]10[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]10[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]sase_core_big_file_split.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/sase_core_big_file_split.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-14s[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-14s/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split crates/sase_core_py/src/lib.rs[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]py_bindings[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]py_bindings: decompose the 35,166-line PyO3 binding crate root into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]domain-keyed module tree while keeping the `sase_core_rs` pymodule [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]registration intact.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split crates/sase_core/src/agent_scan/index.rs[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]agent_scan_index[dim] · [dim][/dim]after py_bindings[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent_scan_index: decompose the 13,468-line agent artifact index module [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into wire types, index maintenance, query, and alias/output-variable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]history submodules.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split crates/sase_core/src/bead/mutation.rs[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bead_mutation[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agent_scan_index[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead_mutation: decompose the 11,316-line bead mutation module along its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]create/update/claim/close/link/store seams.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split crates/sase_core/src/fleet_contract.rs[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fleet_contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bead_mutation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fleet_contract: decompose the 10,548-line fleet wire contract into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fleet_contract/ module tree grouped by contract area.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split crates/sase_gateway/src/routes.rs[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]gateway_routes[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fleet_contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gateway_routes: decompose the 10,062-line axum router module into state,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]router assembly, and per-area handler submodules.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split crates/sase_xprompt_lsp/src/server.rs[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]lsp_server[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gateway_routes[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lsp_server: decompose the 9,939-line LSP server module into [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-LSP-capability submodules behind the existing server entry point.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split crates/sase_core/src/agent_launch/mod.rs[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]agent_launch[dim] · [dim][/dim]after lsp_server[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent_launch: move the 7,978-line agent_launch crate-module body out of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mod.rs into new siblings so mod.rs becomes a thin facade.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split crates/sase_core/src/editor/completion.rs[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]editor_completion[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agent_launch[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]editor_completion: decompose the 7,260-line editor completion module by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion source and by ranking/rendering concern.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  9 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split crates/sase_core/src/xprompt_catalog.rs[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]xprompt_catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]after editor_completion[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]xprompt_catalog: decompose the 4,850-line xprompt catalog module into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]xprompt_catalog/ module tree.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  10 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split crates/sase_gateway/src/sudo_runner.rs[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sudo_runner[dim] · [dim][/dim]after xprompt_catalog[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sudo_runner: decompose the 4,595-line gateway sudo runner into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sudo_runner/ module tree and close out the epic's file-size invariant.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-14s","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-14s.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-2ab6a2a0095aac8131e1aa64f83fa36f","started_at":"2026-09-20T23:24:47.420352+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"e91a754db899596cc2573e8e575906b1f8e5250239b7970e619915bb913a8f5e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14s.8/chat.md","size_bytes":3664},"commits":{"digest":"20669e4f8d714bd6c1ef8b8a31792e49f99244ea92cb3575a25b71bb968d6203","path":"ag